<!-- ORIGIN — why / what / who (added 8/22) -->
<section class="vh-origin" id="origin">
  <div class="wrap" style="max-width:760px;text-align:center;padding:56px 0 44px">
    <div style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.72rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#9C5A34;font-weight:600">Where Triplicity came from</div>
    <h2 style="margin:12px 0 16px">I&rsquo;ve sat in the seat you&rsquo;re in.</h2>
    <p style="max-width:60ch;margin:0 auto 22px;font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.6">I ran companies before I coached anyone who runs one.</p>
    <p style="max-width:60ch;margin:0 auto 22px;font-size:1.6rem;line-height:1;opacity:.45;letter-spacing:.12em">&hellip;</p>
    <a href="#" class="btn btn-primary" data-open-origin style="display:inline-block">Read the story</a>
  </div>
</section>
<div id="vh-origin-modal" aria-hidden="true" style="position:fixed;inset:0;z-index:2147483000;display:none">
  <div data-close-origin style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.74)"></div>
  <div role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-label="Where Triplicity came from" style="position:relative;width:min(760px,94vw);margin:5vh auto;background:#14161c;color:#f3efe6;border:1px solid #2c303a;border-radius:14px;padding:40px 44px 34px;max-height:88vh;overflow:auto;font-family:Georgia,'Fraunces',serif;box-shadow:0 30px 90px rgba(0,0,0,.55)">
    <button type="button" data-close-origin aria-label="Close" style="position:absolute;top:8px;right:14px;background:none;border:0;font-size:30px;line-height:1;color:#a9adb6;cursor:pointer;padding:2px 8px">&times;</button>
    <p style="font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#c9a96e;margin:0 0 10px">Where Triplicity came from</p>
    <h2 style="font-size:2rem;line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 18px;color:#f3efe6;font-weight:500">I&rsquo;ve sat in the seat you&rsquo;re in.</h2>
    <div class="vh-origin-body" style="font-size:1.05rem;line-height:1.7;font-weight:300"><p>For twenty years I led organizations &mdash; as a CEO, an executive director, a board chair, and the attorney who structured the partnerships underneath them. I raised the capital, ran the teams, and sat through the meetings where a company outgrew the way its founders led it. I also did the other work: breathwork, nonviolent communication, men&rsquo;s work, martial arts &mdash; not as hobbies, but because at a certain level the job is not technical. It is whether you can hold the pressure you asked for.</p><p>What I learned is simple and rarely said: a deal can be structured perfectly and still fail because of how someone shows up inside it. Partners don&rsquo;t break over strategy. They break over the conversation they never had.</p><p>Triplicity is executive coaching for founders, partners, and co-leaders moving through change &mdash; a succession, an exit, a new co-founder dynamic, a season of fast growth. Presence-led and practical: lead yourself first, then lead together. Fit-first, starting small, building from there.</p><p>Triplicity is one of four practices under <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Vault Human</a> &mdash; a family of companies built so one relationship can hold a whole life: the legal, the financial, the human, and the lasting. The essay that started it is called <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com/writing/the-fracture" target="_blank" rel="noopener">The Fracture</a>.</p><p style="margin-top:22px">&mdash; Russ Michaels</p></div>
    <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;margin-top:26px">
      <a href="#start" data-close-origin data-open-form style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;border:1px solid #c9a96e;border-radius:6px;color:#14161c;background:#c9a96e;text-decoration:none;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;font-weight:600">Book a fit call</a>
      <a href="https://www.vaulthuman.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;border:1px solid #8B9299;border-radius:6px;color:#f3efe6;text-decoration:none;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif">Vault Human &rarr;</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
